---
title: Shakshuka
servings: 2
tags: [eggs, vegetarian]
---

Fry @ui{1}, @knoflook{2%tenen} and @rode paprika{1} in @olijfolie{1%el} until soft. Add @komijn{1%tl}.

Pour in @passata{500%g} and simmer for ~{10%minutes}. Season with @zout.

Make four wells, crack in @egg{4}, cover and cook until the whites set.

Crumble over @?feta{100%g} and scatter over @verse koriander{}.
